window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>***This omnibus contains the first two novels in the Nexus Games series: The Nexus Games, and The Nexus Knight, both of which are available separately.***<br> <br> <b>Alex Kellan has a strange problem.</b><br> <br> It's Christmas and two men are actively dogging his every step. And while Kellan would love to just be left alone, his stalkers have different plans. They intend to take Kellan to a twisted dimension of high-tech weaponry and magic.. and then force him to compete on their team.<br> <br> Welcome to the Nexus Games!<br> <br> \"Ugh, what is this? And these were my good book-reading eyes.\" <b>- Bitso</b></p>"; 
